  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Dr. Harbhajan Ram And Others vs State Of Punjab And Ors on 31 August, 2016 Author: Jaswant Singh Bench: Jaswant Singh Cwp No.11858 of 2016(O&M) #1# In The High Court Of Punjab & Haryana At Chandigarh. Cwp No.11858 of 2016(O&M) Date of Decision:-31.08.2016 Dr. Harbhajan Ram & Ors. ......Petitioners. Versus State of Punjab & Ors. ......Respondents. Coram:- Hon'Ble Mr. Justice Jaswant Singh Present:- Mr. Rps Bara, Advocate for the Petitioners. Mz. Sudeepti Sharma, Deputy Advocate General, Punjab.",
    "facts": "In addition to their posts, they were notified as Designated Officers under the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006. Since the government had initiated the process of promoting the private respondents no.4 to 23, working as Food Safety Officers to the rank of designated Officers perhaps in places of the petitioners. The present writ petition was filed primarily raising the issue that the private respondents being ineligible could not be promoted.",
